tei:div.tei:p:
skad phyi ma dang thug pa'o///
//
/ skabs 'dir/ bstan chos su mi the na'ang*/ chos rje rang byung rdo rje'i thugs dam rnying ma'i skor las/ dgos kyi bstan 'gyur gyi zla ma bzhengs pa la/ rdzogs chen gyi rgyud/ bka' bsrungs kyi bskor dang bcas pa la/ (ka)pa la sgra thal 'gyur gyi rgyud de'i 'grel pa rin chen snang byed sgron ma zhes bya ba/ mkhas pa bye ma la mu tras mdzad pa bzhugs/ (na*)pa la rnal 'byor snang ba'i tshogs rgyud chen po dang*/ skabs sbyor bdun pa'i rgyud nges par bstan pa'i 'bras bus bskor ba dang*/ rgyud kyi rgyal po chen po ting nge 'dzin mchog gi rgyud dang*/ dpal snying rje rol pa'i rgyud gsang ba zab mo'i mchog ces bya ba dang*/ lha mo sgyu 'phrul zhes bya ba'i rgyud gsang ba'i de kho na nyid nges pa dang*/ gsang ba'i snying po de kho na nyid nges pa dang*/ khro bo chen po'i stobs kyi rnal 'byor dbang phyug bsgrub pa'i rgyud/ sangs rgyas kyi gsang sngags bstan pa sum bcu pa zhes bya ba/ rnal 'byor chen po'i rgyud dang*/ rdo rje sems dpa'i sgyu 'phrul dra ba gsal bar byed pa/ theg pa chen po'i rgyud/ dam tshig chen po thams cad bkod pa'i rgyal po'i rgyud rnams bzhugs/ (pa)pa la chos thams cad rdzogs pa chen po byang chub kyi sems kun byed rgyal po/ sangs rgyas thams cad kyi dgongs pa 'dus pa'i mdo/ theg pa chen po mngon par rtogs pa chos thams cad kyi me long*/ bka' thams cad kyi 'grel pa/ rgyud kyi rgyal po chen po rdo rje bkod pa/ kun 'dus rig pa'i mdo bzhugs/ (pha)pa la chos thams cad rdzogs pa chen po byang chub kyi sems kyi 'dus pa'i mdo/ ye shes rngam pa klog gi 'khor lo'i mdo/ spyod pa thams cad kyi rgyal po brtson pa don ldan gyi rgyud/ rdo rje sems dpa'i lta ba man ngag byang chub kyi sems bsgom pa dang*/ man ngag mngon shes rig pa'i gnad dgu
